  "instructions": "The original Django task is rebuilt on an in-memory `Store` (see `ecom/store.py`, read-only). Wrap the provided `GoogleMapsApi` behind `MapAdapter` in `ecom/adapters/google_map_adapter.py` (convert coordinates to its `GoogleLocation`). In `ecom/services/product_service_impl.py` estimate the delivery as now + travel time from the seller warehouse to the hub of the user zipcode + travel time from the hub to the user, raising `ProductNotFoundError` or `AddressNotFoundError` for missing data. `ProductController.get_estimated_delivery` (`ecom/controllers/product_controller.py`) returns `FAILURE` instead of raising.",
